      "writtenOn": "2024-10-08T17:10:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not favoring the fact that `mExpected` is now a field and has a dependency on a  call to `SetAndGetDynamicsProcessingParameters` in order to set it. I would suggest making `expected` an output argument of this method so that any other code which needs to know an expected error will not forget to call this method.",
