      "message": "This allows `enable` to be `false`. Does that disables processing? If it is so, where do we check that behavior is different depending on this setting? Also, when processing is disabled, it probably does not make sense to test all the combinations of parameters, just check that using a non-default parameter value does not affect the output.",
